# Records and enumerations

The active state has primitive value {{ currentStatus }}.

```amx
type Identifier {
  id: String
}

type Named {
  id: String
  name: String
}

type Asset extends Identifier, Named {
  override id: String
  status: Number
}

enum Status = {
  DRAFT,
  ACTIVE,
  CLOSED
}

let asset: Asset = Asset { id = "A-1", name = "Pump", status = Status.ACTIVE }
let currentStatus: Number = Status.ACTIVE
```
